<title>USA: Saul Centers Q1 net rises, FFO shr $0.41.</title>
<headline>Saul Centers Q1 net rises, FFO shr $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>CHEVY CHASE, Md. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p> Net shr		    $0.18		    $0.14</p>
<p> FFO shr		    $0.41		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net			  2,167		    1,686</p>
<p> Revs			16,562		   15,633</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,165		   11,916</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Saul Centers Inc.</p>
<p>FFO (Funds From Operations) is computed as net income plus minority interests, extraordinary item and depreciation and amortization. Before those factors, net income for the current three-month period totaled $4,249,000, compared with $3,399,000 in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
